@baseUrl = http://localhost:7101

### Root
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Controller binding
GET {{baseUrl}}/controller/42?message=controller

### Controller JSON binding
POST {{baseUrl}}/controller/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"controller"}

### Minimal route/query binding
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimal/42?message=minimal

### Minimal JSON binding
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimal/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"minimal"}

### Custom HTTP status/header/cookies
GET {{baseUrl}}/response

### Binary response
GET {{baseUrl}}/binary

### Delayed streamed response
GET {{baseUrl}}/stream

### Upload to temporary file; receive byte count and SHA-256 after deletion
POST {{baseUrl}}/stream/upload
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

streamed bytes

### Application error policy
GET {{baseUrl}}/error

### Unknown route
GET {{baseUrl}}/missing

### Unsupported method
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/controller/42
